sample.wlpkg: a throwaway-key package of 5000 random bytes, made with
  tools/sign.py sign --cpu esp32c6 --version 7 --fqdn dl.example.org --image img.bin
The key is not used anywhere else.
manifest.wlpkg: the same key, a zero-length Main manifest (tools/sign.py --request-loader), for the
"reboot into the loader" test.
